---
import BaseLayout from "@/layouts/BaseLayout.astro";
---

<BaseLayout
  title="Privacy Policy — Indian Keto"
  description="Indian Keto privacy policy. Learn how we collect, use, and protect your personal information."
>
  <section class="py-16">
    <div class="max-w-3xl mx-auto px-4">
      <h1 class="text-4xl font-display font-semibold text-primary mb-6">Privacy Policy</h1>
      <div class="prose-keto">
        <p>Last updated: August 2026</p>
        <p>Indian Keto ("we," "our," or "us") is committed to protecting your privacy. This Privacy Policy explains how we collect, use, and safeguard your information when you visit indianketo.com.</p>
        <h2>Information We Collect</h2>
        <p>We may collect the following types of information:</p>
        <ul>
          <li><strong>Email address</strong> — When you subscribe to our newsletter.</li>
          <li><strong>Usage data</strong> — Pages visited, time on site, and other analytics via Google Analytics.</li>
        </ul>
        <h2>How We Use Your Information</h2>
        <p>We use your information to:</p>
        <ul>
          <li>Send you our newsletter with Indian keto recipes and tips (if you've subscribed).</li>
          <li>Improve our website and content based on usage patterns.</li>
        </ul>
        <h2>Cookies</h2>
        <p>We use cookies for analytics and site functionality. You can disable cookies in your browser settings.</p>
        <h2>Third-Party Services</h2>
        <p>We use Google Analytics for site analytics and may use email marketing services for our newsletter. These services have their own privacy policies.</p>
        <h2>Contact</h2>
        <p>For questions about this policy, contact us at <a href="mailto:hello@indianketo.com">hello@indianketo.com</a>.</p>
      </div>
    </div>
  </section>
</BaseLayout>
